{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226540","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226540","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422654001:1":{"text":"斐利尔种下的花，与这里的颜色虽然不同，但感觉很相似。","source_cn":"斐利尔种下的花，与这里的颜色虽然不同，但感觉很相似。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC732BC47B9E58EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422654002:1":{"text":"年轻人，你也喜欢花吗？","source_cn":"年轻人，你也喜欢花吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94A0B126A238D1A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422654003:1":{"text":"打扰了，这花圃是你的吗？我没有恶意，只是想近看下这些美丽的花朵。","source_cn":"打扰了，这花圃是你的吗？我没有恶意，只是想近看下这些美...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC23555DCE4FCFF77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422654004:1":{"text":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","source_cn":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9940382AE30A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1422654004":{"text":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","source_cn":"我有个朋友，也喜欢种花。他曾在萨洛克兰培育出一种新的花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEF9940382AE30A36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422654005:1":{"text":"在如此恶劣的环境下，却能孕育出美丽的花朵？那定是种花之人的心灵，影响了花的模样。","source_cn":"在如此恶劣的环境下，却能孕育出美丽的花朵？那定是种花之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36C028211454CB87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422654006:1":{"text":"是的，斐利尔……我是说我的朋友他，非常喜欢花朵。","source_cn":"是的，斐利尔……我是说我的朋友他，非常喜欢花朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58F9A4FD0DD5F111","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422654007:1":{"text":"我们那里不太适宜植物生长，他也没什么机会接触不同的品种，只能就地取材……","source_cn":"我们那里不太适宜植物生长，他也没什么机会接触不同的品种...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF009B3AAEAF30BB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422654008:1":{"text":"那样的话，要不要从我这里取些花草回去送给他？这些都是我精心培育的珍品，独一无二！","source_cn":"那样的话，要不要从我这里取些花草回去送给他？这些都是我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCE3D28DCA05003E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422654009:1":{"text":"它们极为坚韧，无论何处都能茁壮成长。除了美丽，还有药用与食用价值！","source_cn":"它们极为坚韧，无论何处都能茁壮成长。除了美丽，还有药用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66B5BF0CE0B133E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422654010:1":{"text":"他……已经不在了。","source_cn":"他……已经不在了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEEC161B7D6B2DE61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422654011:1":{"text":"……这，抱歉啊！我不清楚这事。","source_cn":"……这，抱歉啊！我不清楚这事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A092964A201A5CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422654012:1":{"text":"无妨。我确实想带些回去，让萨洛克兰的人们见识一番。只是我匆忙而来，没带什么值钱之物——","source_cn":"无妨。我确实想带些回去，让萨洛克兰的人们见识一番。只是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF41A40ED439FC154","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422654013:1":{"text":"哈哈，不必如此！以花会友罢了。要是我培育的这些花能在他乡绽放，那就是最大的喜悦了！","source_cn":"哈哈，不必如此！以花会友罢了。要是我培育的这些花能在他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D043C5D4792EDA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422654014:1":{"text":"可，这是你精心培育的品种，我不能——","source_cn":"可，这是你精心培育的品种，我不能——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4633F868E81E6747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422654015:1":{"text":"我不是通商的商人，只是个花匠，对我而言，最宝贵的东西从来都不是金钱。","source_cn":"我不是通商的商人，只是个花匠，对我而言，最宝贵的东西从...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9694B9495D9E66F1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422654016:1":{"text":"爱着花朵，想要培育花朵的心，他人从花朵中得到的喜悦——","source_cn":"爱着花朵，想要培育花朵的心，他人从花朵中得到的喜悦——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA189C459943AE8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422654017:1":{"text":"阳光、月光、风雨，还有这些动物——这一切一切，才是无与伦比的宝贵财富。","source_cn":"阳光、月光、风雨，还有这些动物——这一切一切，才是无与...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF51114EB1B58C445","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422654018:1":{"text":"何况，在皎月树的守护下，我一定能培育出更多的花种！","source_cn":"何况，在皎月树的守护下，我一定能培育出更多的花种！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4F3556738486B92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422654019:1":{"text":"皎月树的守护？那是？","source_cn":"皎月树的守护？那是？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73867BDD06318E70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1422654020:1":{"text":"哈哈，就是你面前这颗起舞的大树。它是滋养周围生灵的守护之树。","source_cn":"哈哈，就是你面前这颗起舞的大树。它是滋养周围生灵的守护之树。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25C07944ABCF7121","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","vari